- ABAC with aws:PrincipalTag for tenant-scoped access
- S3 Access Points and per-tenant prefixes for isolation
- Tenant-scoped KMS keys with rotation
- EventBridge + Lambda + Step Functions for rapid containment
- Immutable audit trails with CloudTrail and S3 Object Lock

